# ==============================================================================
# Static MAC/IP to Hostname Mapping Table
# Location: /etc/buffalo-dhcp-dns/hosts.map
#
# Syntax:
#   <MAC_or_IP>    <Hostname>    [Description / Comment]
#
# Notes:
#   - MAC addresses can be formatted with colons (aa:bb:cc:dd:ee:ff),
#     hyphens (aa-bb-cc-dd-ee-ff), or plain 12 hex chars.
#   - Hostnames must follow standard DNS label rules (a-z, 0-9, hyphens).
#   - Empty lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# ==============================================================================

# Examples:
# VLAN 20 devices
00:11:22:33:44:01    reception-pc01     # Front reception counter
00:11:22:33:44:02    meeting-display    # 2F Meeting Room A display

# VLAN 100 devices
00:11:22:33:44:03    guest-kiosk-01     # Entrance iPad Kiosk

# By static reservation IP (if preferred over MAC):
# 192.168.20.150     lab-printer-color

